Package: dataraft
Title: Modular Workflows for Checked Data Products
Version: 0.1.0.9005
Authors@R: person("Jan-Hendrik", "Weinert", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "65009403+JanWein@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Installs a family of cooperating packages for checked data
    products. Product specifications define requirements, recipes define ordered
    preparation steps and workflows bind them to sources and destinations.
    Optional components provide lake storage, adapters, dbt, catalogs and metrics.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: dataraft.core (>= 0.1.0.9005), dataraft.lake (>= 0.1.0.9005), dataraft.adapters (>= 0.1.0.9005), dataraft.dbt (>= 0.1.0.9005),
    dataraft.metrics (>= 0.1.0.9005)
